DEVOUT  AND  HOLY  LIFE.  115 

that  you  are  to  condemn  in  the  same  degree,  and  for 
the  same  reasons.  They  do  not  commit  a  small  mis- 
take, but  are  wrong-  in  that  which  is  their  all,  and  mis- 
