DEVOUT  AND  HOLY  LIFE.  137 

But  here  a  new  project  comes  in  to  his  relief.  He 
is  now  living-  upon  herbs,  and  running  about  the  coun- 
try, to  get  himself  into  as  good  wind  as  any  running 
