iiite  numbers  of  angels  now  worship  in  heaven ;  this 
great  God,  who  is  the  Cieator  of  worlds,  of  angels, 
and  men,  is  your  lovuig  Father  and  Friend,  your  good 
Creator  and  Nourishcr,  from  whom,  and  not  from  me, 
