260  A  SEUIOUS  CALL  TO  A 

frees  from  worldly  cares  and  troubles^  and  furnislies 
means  and  opportunities  of  liie,lier  advancement  in  a  ' 
divine  life ;  therefore^  love,  and  esteem^  and  honour 
